# LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# Not a style preference. `shared/partner-openapi.yaml` is verified by sha256
# against the hash recorded in shared/SPEC.md, and the fixtures in
# shared/fixtures are hashed and signed byte-for-byte by tests in three
# languages. If Git rewrote line endings on a Windows checkout, every one of
# those checks would pass in CI and fail on a contributor's machine, for a
# reason that looks nothing like line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
